WHERE id = 2802;

-- Q2809: C Corporations [medium/L2]
-- Issues: #1, #3
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["E&P decreases by the $100,000 FMV of the property distributed","E&P decreases by the $40,000 adjusted basis of the property distributed","E&P decreases by $40,000 after netting the gain recognized against FMV","E&P increases by $60,000 gain and then decreases by $100,000 FMV distributed"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under Section 311(b), the corporation recognizes gain as if the property were sold at FMV, increasing E&P by $60,000 ($100,000 FMV minus $40,000 basis). E&P is then reduced by the $100,000 FMV distributed, producing a net $40,000 decrease.
Wrong (A): E&P is not simply reduced by FMV alone; the gain recognition step must be accounted for first.
Wrong (B): Using adjusted basis alone ignores the mandatory gain recognition under Section 311(b).
Wrong (C): While the net effect is $40,000, this choice incorrectly describes the mechanics by skipping the two-step gain-then-distribution process.$EXPL$
WHERE id = 2809;

