  choices = $EXPL$["Provide a workplace free from recognized hazards likely to cause serious harm","Purchase personal health insurance coverage for all current employees","Guarantee that zero workplace injuries will occur during each calendar year","Allow employees to refuse any assigned task they consider to be unpleasant"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under the Occupational Safety and Health Act, 29 U.S.C. Section 654(a)(1) (the general duty clause), employers must furnish a workplace free from recognized hazards that are causing or likely to cause death or serious physical harm.
