  choices = $EXPL$["Straight-line depreciation over the regular tax recovery period for the asset","The units-of-production method based on actual output during the year","The 150% declining balance method calculated over the asset''s class life","No depreciation deduction is permitted for alternative minimum tax purposes"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Section 56(a)(1), tangible personal property depreciated using 200% declining balance for regular tax must use the 150% declining balance method over the property''s class life for AMT purposes. The difference creates a timing adjustment in computing AMTI.
